      <activity id="85fc529e-922e-5fcb-9e84-8edc04164ae4" activityNameId="1d10e181-200b-55c1-9339-7542c673cffc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, electric utility Obwalden, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, electric utility Obwalden, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.;
UUID: bb064aa8-08f6-3d0b-aa1e-9270f15022e4
Included are the electricity production in the electric utility Obwalden, the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to the supply area of the electric utility Obwalden.
Technology: Average technology used to distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bb064aa8-08f6-3d0b-aa1e-9270f15022e4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
